# ---- I. Sensors / IIO [low]: the tablet's sensors come through the ADSP (fastrpc + hexagonrpcd + iio-sensor-proxy),
#      /sys/class/iio is empty; only the PMIC ADC5-gen3 (board thermistors) uses IIO and needs no buffers/triggers.
#      Power-allocator thermal governor: no "sustainable-power" in any DT, step_wise is the default (patch 0069).
# CONFIG_IIO_ST_LSM6DSX is not set
# CONFIG_IIO_ST_MAGN_3AXIS is not set
# CONFIG_VCNL4000 is not set
# CONFIG_TI_ADS1015 is not set
# CONFIG_XILINX_XADC is not set
# CONFIG_IIO_SIMPLE_DUMMY is not set
# CONFIG_IIO_CONFIGFS is not set
# CONFIG_IIO_SW_DEVICE is not set
# CONFIG_IIO_SW_TRIGGER is not set
# CONFIG_IIO_BUFFER is not set
# CONFIG_IIO_TRIGGERED_BUFFER is not set
# CONFIG_IIO_KFIFO_BUF is not set
# CONFIG_IIO_TRIGGER is not set
# CONFIG_GPIO_SIM is not set
# CONFIG_THERMAL_GOV_POWER_ALLOCATOR is not set

# ---- J. Networking [low unless noted]: wired NICs that cannot be on this tablet (lspci: only the WCN7860),
#      Ethernet PHYs for them, other Wi-Fi/BT vendors, WWAN/NFC/GNSS, VM/container-only netdevs.
#      KEPT: USB Ethernet adapters (drivers/net/usb, not under ETHERNET), their PHYs (AX88796B/SMSC/MICROCHIP are
#      selected by the USB drivers), TUN, nftables/iptables-nft, conntrack, policy routing, WireGuard module,
#      USB Bluetooth dongles (BT_HCIBTUSB), WLAN_VENDOR_ATH + ATH_REG_DYNAMIC_USER_REG_HINTS (baldur.fragment).
# CONFIG_ETHERNET is not set
# CONFIG_QCOM_IPA is not set
