# [medium] bridge/vlan/veth/macvlan/vxlan: Docker/libvirt/LXC style networking; Tailscale, NM Wi-Fi hotspot
#          (NAT + dnsmasq), flatpak/bwrap (--unshare-net: netns + lo only) and Steam do not use them
